        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia BTB-9031P, Reed Back-To-Back Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Back-to-Back Reed Door Pull Set comes packaged as a pair of pulls with the mounting hardware needed to install them on either side of a door. The Reed  Door Pull Set is available in 12 inch or 18 inch lengths. Choose from many of Omnia's most popular finish colors including oil rubbed bronze, satin brass, and polished nickel. The Omnia Reed Pull Set has a modern, square grip that is unlike most reeded door pulls on the market. It is this contemporary detail that makes the Reed Back-to-Back Door Pull Pair a perfect choice for transitional homes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Packaged with 2 pulls</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Reed Pull Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BTB-9031P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BTB-9031P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MGR-filigree-detail.jpg?v=1704354535\" width=\"524\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia BTB-9031P Pull is available as a <a href=\"/products/modern-reed-door-pull-omnia-9031p\"><b>Thru-Bolt Mounted Single Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>",
